      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes me feel a bit better. i was just worried it was something serious. but it's kind of weird though, the hardness doesn't really go away even when i change positions, it's just really constant. and the pain is more of a sharp, stabbing feeling now rather than just a dull ache. do you think i should try anything else at home to help loosen things up? maybe a heating pad? i really want to avoid the hospital if i can just manage it here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
